  ratings_DMT            TDMI_gsrglobal_DMT       -0.088   -0.009  0.2384  2/14
  LZ_DMT                 FD_DMT                   +0.086   +0.006  0.4008  2/14
  LZ_PCB                 FD_PCB                   +0.102   -0.010  0.0465  3/14
